  "notes": "Ancient composition under a conventional modern English label. Ur-Namma belongs to its received label and royal framing; authorship, historical legal use, and reconstruction of the surviving wording require their own evidence. Physical witnesses, CDLI Q000947/P432130, modern critical editions, line numbering, and translations provide separately identified routes into the composition.",
